Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(80,140,255,0.15)\" stroke-width=\"0.924\" clip-path=\"url(#cl-_R_15anpfiv5b_)\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-sans font-bold leading-none tracking-tight\" style=\"font-size:13px\"><span class=\"text-navy\">Earned</span><span class=\"text-gold-dark\">Star</span></span></span></a><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-7 md:flex\"><a class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors text-ink/70 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/\">Manifesto</a><a class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors text-ink/70 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/pricing\">Pricing</a><a class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors text-ink/70 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/audit\">The Audit</a><a class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors text-ink/70 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/yotpo-refugees\">Yotpo Refugees</a><a class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors text-ink/70 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/reviews/expedia-parts\">Live Store</a><a class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors text-ink/70 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/design-lab/brand\">Brand</a></div><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-3 md:flex\"><span class=\"smallcaps hidden text-[10px] lg:inline text-ink/70\">Vol. 01 · 2026</span><a data-cx-click=\"merchant-get-started\" class=\"rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-bold text-ink shadow-sm transition-shadow gold-foil hover:shadow-md\" href=\"/signup\">Start free</a></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-md p-2 md:hidden text-ink\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></nav></header><article class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-muted\"><span>Help guide</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>6<!-- --> steps</span></div><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-navy sm:text-4xl\">How to create your EarnedStar account and start your free trial</h1><p class=\"mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-muted\">EarnedStar has no appointment booking — this walks through the real flow on the sign-up page, creating your merchant account and starting a 14-day free trial.</p><ol class=\"mt-8 space-y-5\"><li class=\"card-surface flex gap-4 p-5\"><span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-navy text-sm font-semibold text-white\">1</span><div><p class=\"text-base font-medium text-ink\">Go to the sign-up page.</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted\">It opens directly on the &quot;Create Account&quot; form — there&#x27;s no separate tab to click first.</p></div></li><li class=\"card-surface flex gap-4 p-5\"><span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-navy text-sm font-semibold text-white\">2</span><div><p class=\"text-base font-medium text-ink\">Fill in your business name, email, and a password in the sign-up form.</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted\">A strength meter below the password field shows whether it&#x27;s Weak, Okay, or Strong.</p></div></li><li class=\"card-surface flex gap-4 p-5\"><span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-navy text-sm font-semibold text-white\">3</span><div><p class=\"text-base font-medium text-ink\">Confirm your password in the second password field.</p></div></li><li class=\"card-surface flex gap-4 p-5\"><span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-navy text-sm font-semibold text-white\">4</span><div><p class=\"text-base font-medium text-ink\">Check the box agreeing to the Terms &amp; Privacy Policy.</p></div></li><li class=\"card-surface flex gap-4 p-5\"><span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-navy text-sm font-semibold text-white\">5</span><div><p class=\"text-base font-medium text-ink\">Click &quot;Create Account — 14-day trial&quot;.</p></div></li><li class=\"card-surface flex gap-4 p-5\"><span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-navy text-sm font-semibold text-white\">6</span><div><p class=\"text-base font-medium text-ink\">Wait to be redirected into your new EarnedStar dashboard.</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted\">The redirect confirms your account and trial were created successfully.</p></div></li></ol><p class=\"mt-12\"><a class=\"text-sm text-text-muted hover:text-navy hover:underline\" href=\"/help\">← All help guides</a></p></article><footer class=\"border-t border-border bg-navy text-white\" data-scroll-theme=\"dark\"><section class=\"py-20 text-center\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl italic text-gold\">Stop guessing if customers trust you.</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-white/70\">Show them proof. 1,200+ stores collect verified reviews with EarnedStar.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border font-semibold transition duration-200 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-navy bg-gold text-ink hover:bg-gold-light border-transparent shadow-[var(--shadow-gold)] h-12 px-6 text-base mt-8\" href=\"/signup\">Start Your Free Trial →</a></div></section><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl border-t border-white/10 px-4 py-12\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:grid-cols-[2fr_1fr_1fr_1fr_1fr]\"><div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg width=\"37\" height=\"37\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 37\" overflow=\"visible\" class=\"shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15.63,9.32 Q18.50,2.15 21.37,9.32 L21.62,9.95 Q22.72,12.69 25.